      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would expect build.config.amlogic to be building against gki_defconfig + `amlogic_gki.fragment`, as illustrated here: \n\nhttps://r.android.com/3265858/2/build.config.amlogic#6\n\nSo, perhaps it shouldn\u0027t change gki_defconfig directly, but in your kernel_build(), use defconfig_fragments?\n\nhttps://android.googlesource.com/kernel/build/+/refs/heads/main/kleaf/docs/kernel_config.md#kernel_build_defconfig_fragments\n\nand set defconfig_fragments to be `arch/arm64/configs/amlogic_gki.fragment` in your case.\n\n(Though, defconfig_fragments is applied at `POST_DEFCONFIG_CMDS` not `PRE_DEFCONFIG_CMDS`, so it is slightly different; so please double check if the final .config is the same if you are going to use defconfig_fragments. We will also provide a `pre_defconfig_fragments`, but that\u0027s TBD)",
